<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Scottish</p>
<p>premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>14 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic)</p>
<p>12 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic)</p>
<p>11 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen), Paul Gascoigne (Rangers)</p>
<p>10 - John Robertson (Hearts), Darren Jackson (Hibernian)</p>
<p>9 - Ally McCoist (Rangers), Gerry Britton (Dunfermline)</p>
<p>8 - Paolo Di Canio (Celtic)</p>
